 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Inputs:** Ray origin, ray direction, volume density/opacity samples, transfer function parameters, bounding box, and step size.
-*   **Outputs:** `outRGB` (accumulated color), `outDepth` (accumulated depth), `outOpacity` (accumulated opacity).
